            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nWe suggest you read the previous text and the one about addition with the *Yupana*. Also read their prerequisites before continuing",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "fbd5bb5a-58fd-4c14-a7b8-7cab2ed2560b",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Inversion",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2025",
                        "month": "-1",
                        "day": "-1"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
