      {
         "id": "SECTION_conclusion",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Conclusion\n\nIn this text, we studied another part of the *Yupana Inka Tawa Pukllay* method made by Dhavit Prem (<htcite0>; <htcite1>). This study suggests that the people of *Tawantinsuyu* may have reached the same math conclusions as other civilizations about the link between multiplication and addition.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "a62b520a-f443-4d83-ab51-b99c9a46dab8",
                     "text": "Dhavit Prem",
                     "page": "pp. 360 - 361",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2018",
                        "month": "-1",
                        "day": "-1"
                     }
                  },
                  {
